{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:be8dfc9dcbc47ef9","name":"Corellian Nemesis-Class Patrol Ship","source":{"id":"source:reference-be8dfc9dcbc47ef9","title":"Corellian Nemesis-Class Patrol Ship","revision":20122,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:15:31Z","sha256":"4a6d06f32001893e8a7033a8e23ad5a3f11aec02794b837c65a7349f42932c14","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20122","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Corellian%20Nemesis-Class%20Patrol%20Ship&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-be8dfc9dcbc47ef9","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Black Sun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Black_Sun","referenceId":"reference:5c22b34bff28e06d"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The ",{"tag":"i","children":["Nemesis"]},"-Class Patrol Ship, built by the Corellian Engineering Corporation, isn't new. It's been around since before ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Sith-Imperial War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Sith-Imperial_War"}," and is primarily sold to outlying worlds and smaller governments that require light but reliable armed patrol craft. The ship's durability, along with its advanced sensors and computer systems, make it popular with law enforcement. Its limited weaponry restricts its military usage. One popular feature is that the ship can be flown with as few as two crew members. The ship's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Laser Cannons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Laser_Cannons"}," can either be ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fire-Linked"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fire-Linked"}," and controlled by the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Pilot","referenceId":"reference:4aff6d0e54fff36e"},", or